on\", I think we've previously been comfortable adding markup to reflect differences in this sort of language -- since it essentially goes to \"which work does this apply to\" rather than \"what are your rights / obligations under the license\". See for instance #866 / #962. So I wouldn't be too troubled with adding markup for \"documentation\". \r\n\r\nFor your second bullet point, though, yes -- this seems different enough in terms of which language is present vs. optional that I think it warrants a separate identifier.\r\n\r\n+1 to add, and I think the ID and proposed name are probably fine (though just noting it should be \"HPND\" rather than \"HPDN\")","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1725420320/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1725425345","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2124#issuecomment-1725425345","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2124","id":1725425345,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85m1-bB","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_